      "worked_solution": "Writing ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14220541/assets/c535cfb0c35eb52d4b584cc8bba87983c119151dd6205ff9c07bfb81f1e377e7.svg), we have\n\n$$\nf(\\mathbf{x})= \\mathbf{b}^T\\mathbf{x}.\n$$\n\nThe gradient of a function $f(x) = \\mathbf{b}^T\\mathbf{x}$ with respect to $\\mathbf{x} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ is\n\n$$\n\\nabla_{\\mathbf{x}} f(\\mathbf{x}) = \\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14220541/assets/42e988e1ec5a0a7e18837cddb67a6e5a5574223675fc42ad1b0da000dd28a2f4.svg)",
